# Packages installed into the MaluOS live root filesystem (Phase 11 slice 1),
# on top of the Ubuntu bootstrap: the live environment the installer medium
# boots into. The kernel and its initrd are built here, with casper's hooks
# and the plymouth theme inside, and copied out onto the medium by
# iso/build-live-iso.sh; the bootloaders (BIOS and the signed UEFI chain) are
# taken from this rootfs by the same script. No database, no cloud-init.
ubuntu-minimal
maluos-live
linux-generic
linux-firmware
grub-pc-bin
grub-efi-amd64-signed
grub-efi-amd64-bin
shim-signed
grub2-common
zstd
